# Qt UI thread

The UI thread paints and displays hypotheses. Detection, join search, assembly search, and HTR run on local workers, through the same use cases as the CLI.

Do:

```python
worker.finished.connect(view.show_hypotheses)
worker.start()
label.setText(f"Hypothesis rank {rank} · {epistemic_class}")
```

Don't:

```python
def on_click(self):
    self.view.show(run_htr(image))
    self.view.set_title("The reconstruction")
```

Visible labels say hypothesis and show epistemic class and text status.
